---
const code = Astro.url.searchParams.get('code');
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Authenticating...</title>
    <style>
        body { background: #0A0A0A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: sans-serif; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0; }
        .card { background: #111; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; max-width: 500px; }
        .code { color: #F59E0B; font-family: monospace; word-break: break-all; margin: 1rem 0; background: #000; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1 style="color: #F59E0B;">HANDSHAKE DETECTED</h1>
        <p>The Gabbai has received your authorization code.</p>
        <div class="code">{code}</div>
        <p>Please copy this code and paste it back into our chat so I can finalize the connection to your estate.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
